  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Sustainable Urban Marketplace: Participatory urban governance for safe, green and inclusive fresh market management in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote smart, participatory integrated urban development through peer partnership among EU Member States and Indonesian urban LAs, advancing sustainable urban governance agenda praxis in line with New Green Deal, AGENDA 2030, Paris Agreement &amp; COVID-19 challenges to urban development: contributing to achievement of SDG11</narrative>
  </description>
